{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://ntu-shower.iseekdream.com/schema/session.command.json",
  "title": "Server command to device",
  "allOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "https://ntu-shower.iseekdream.com/schema/envelope.json"
    },
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "session.command"
        },
        "payload": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "action",
            "params",
            "timeout_ms"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "action": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-z]+\\.[a-z_]+$"
            },
            "params": {
              "type": "object"
            },
            "timeout_ms": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "description": "这条命令从发出起还有多少毫秒值得执行。**相对时长，不是绝对时刻**——设备没有 NTP，两边的墙上时钟可能差几秒甚至几分钟；下发绝对时刻会让「设备时钟走得快」这一件事直接导致所有命令被判为已过期，而那与命令本身还值不值得执行毫无关系。设备收到后按「从收到算起」判定，能挡住的主要是「排在自己队列里等太久」这种情形。"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
